in="02:00.818" end="02:02.946">ka？</span></text><text for="L31"><span begin="02:21.603" end="02:22.457">sayona</span><span begin="02:22.457" end="02:23.124">ragaso</span><span begin="02:23.124" end="02:24.042">noshizukesaga</span><span begin="02:24.167" end="02:24.972">sumiwataru</span></text><text for="L32"><span begin="02:24.972" end="02:26.300">saakokogahaji</span><span begin="02:26.300" end="02:26.676">mari</span></text><text for="L33"><span begin="02:26.797" end="02:27.589">「mewosora</span><span begin="02:27.589" end="02:28.122">suna</span><span begin="02:28.122" end="02:29.419">」iikikasetewa</span></text><text for="L34"><span begin="02:29.446" end="02:30.195">saigono</span><span begin="02:30.249" end="02:31.265">hajimemashi</span><span begin="02:31.265" end="02:32.095">teyoroshiku</span></text><text for="L35"><span begin="02:32.095" end="02:32.778">「nemura</span><span begin="02:32.778" end="02:33.274">nai</span><span begin="02:33.274" end="02:33.973">de」karadaga</span><span begin="02:33.973" end="02:34.763">sakenderu</span></text><text for="L36"><span begin="02:34.763" end="02:35.648">hayaganewo</span><span begin="02:35.648" end="02:36.798">uteukibori</span><span begin="02:36.798" end="02:37.398">nohaato</span></text><text for="L37"><span begin="02:37.398" end="02:37.811">ii</span><span begin="02:37.811" end="02:38.611">nokoshita</span><span begin="02:38.611" end="02:39.310">kotobajata</span><span begin="02:39.310" end="02:39.827">yori</span><span begin="02:39.827" end="02:40.742">naikara</span></text><text for="L38"><span begin="02:40.742" end="02:41.894">itsumofumida</span><span begin="02:41.894" end="02:42.587">su</span><span begin="02:42.742" end="02:44.464">zeroichi</span></text><text for="L39"><span begin="02:44.271" end="02:44.927">maido</span><span begin="02:44.927" end="02:46.053">saikouna</span><span begin="02:46.276" end="02:47.543">miraiwo</span><span begin="02:47.543" end="02:47.961"></span><span begin="02:47.961" end="02:48.409"></span><span begin="02:48.409" end="02:48.853"></span></text><text for="L40"><span begin="02:48.915" end="02:49.819">aragau</span><span begin="02:49.819" end="02:50.608">mamaiki</span><span begin="02:50.608" end="02:50.925">rufuko</span><span begin="02:50.925" end="02:51.697">uwo</span><span begin="02:51.697" end="02:52.481"></span><span begin="02:52.481" end="02:53.166"></span><span begin="02:53.166" end="02:54.614"></span><span begin="02:54.614" end="02:54.838"></span></text><text for="L41"><span begin="02:54.838" end="02:55.568">akairono</span><span begin="02:55.568" end="02:56.230">souzou</span><span begin="02:56.230" end="02:56.662">ga</span><span begin="02:56.880" end="02:57.531"></span><span begin="02:57.531" end="02:59.080"></span><span begin="02:59.080" end="02:59.503"></span></text><text for="L42"><span begin="02:59.573" end="03:00.453">warikire</span><span begin="03:00.453" end="03:01.104">naiko</span><span begin="03:01.104" end="03:01.552">noriyu</span><span begin="03:01.552" end="03:02.010">uwo</span><span begin="03:02.320" end="03:03.120"></span><span begin="03:03.120" end="03:03.943"></span><span begin="03:03.943" end="03:04.308"></span><span begin="03:04.308" end="03:05.677"></span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:06.768"><div begin="00:12.746" end="03:05.677"><p begin="00:12.746" end="00:14.968" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:12.746" end="00:13.285">これが</span><span begin="00:13.285" end="00:13.951">最後と</span><span begin="00:13.951" end="00:14.615">決めまし</span><span begin="00:14.615" end="00:14.968">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">决定了这就是最后一次</span></p><p begin="00:14.968" end="00:18.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:14.968" end="00:15.632">アイツは</span><span begin="00:15.632" end="00:16.284">言った</span><span begin="00:16.284" end="00:17.477">「死んだらどうな</span><span begin="00:17.477" end="00:18.041">る？」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个人问“要是死掉了怎么办？”</span></p><p begin="00:18.135" end="00:20.265" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:18.135" end="00:18.599">そこで</span><span begin="00:18.599" end="00:19.301">ナイフが</span><span begin="00:19.301" end="00:19.965">飛び出し</span><span begin="00:19.965" end="00:20.265">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恰在此时一把匕首飞来</span></p><p begin="00:20.265" end="00:23.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:20.265" end="00:21.435">呆気なかった</span><span begin="00:21.435" end="00:22.467">涙よりも</span><span begin="00:22.467" end="00:22.801">早</span><span begin="00:22.801" end="00:23.289">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比眼泪还要突然和迅速</span></p><p begin="00:23.459" end="00:26.089" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:23.459" end="00:24.019">あのね</span><span begin="00:24.110" end="00:25.296">ここで消えたら</span><span begin="00:25.296" end="00:26.089">意味ないし</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要我说 消失在这里毫无意义</span></p><p begin="00:26.089" end="00:28.725" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:26.089" end="00:26.766">ろうそく</span><span begin="00:26.766" end="00:27.310">のように</span><span begin="00:27.310" end="00:28.294">固まれ血の</span><span begin="00:28.294" end="00:28.725">ワルツ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蜡烛般凝固的血液</span></p><p begin="00:28.772" end="00:32.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:28.772" end="00:29.457">繋げ</span><span begin="00:29.457" end="00:29.940">ていない</span><span begin="00:29.940" end="00:30.975">手がこんなに</span><span begin="00:30.975" end="00:31.460">ある</span><span begin="00:31.460" end="00:31.791">のに</span><span begin="00:31.791" end="00:32.207">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有那么多手</span></p><p begin="00:32.247" end="00:34.899" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:32.247" end="00:32.631">ねぇ</span><span begin="00:32.631" end="00:33.799">死んだらどうな</span><span begin="00:33.799" end="00:34.899">る？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要是死掉了的话怎么办啊？</span></p><p begin="00:44.727" end="00:46.898" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:44.727" end="00:45.279">そこで</span><span begin="00:45.279" end="00:45.812">誰を</span><span begin="00:45.812" end="00:46.898">恨みますか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么要去憎恨某人吗</span></p><p begin="00:46.898" end="00:49.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:46.898" end="00:48.279">矢のように去っては</span><span begin="00:48.279" end="00:48.946">過ぎてく</span><span begin="00:48.946" end="00:49.884">季節</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时光如疾射的箭矢般流逝</span></p><p begin="00:50.044" end="00:52.271" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:50.044" end="00:51.287">譲れないまま</span><span begin="00:51.287" end="00:51.620">持ち</span><span begin="00:51.620" end="00:51.905">直し</span><span begin="00:51.905" end="00:52.271">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一步不退的情况下逐渐好转</span></p><p begin="00:52.271" end="00:55.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:52.271" end="00:53.604">許せばきっと</span> <span begin="00:53.658" end="00:54.442">忘れちゃえ</span> <span begin="00:54.442" end="00:55.421">なにもかも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果可以的话</span></p><p begin="00:55.436" end="00:58.155" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:55.436" end="00:56.116">行く先</span><span begin="00:56.116" end="00:57.300">やさしさが断つ</span><span begin="00:57.300" end="00:58.155">帰り道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前路是温柔斩断的归路</span></p><p begin="00:58.155" end="01:00.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:58.155" end="00:58.939">振り返る</span><span begin="00:58.939" end="01:00.121">背にかなしげな</span><span begin="01:00.121" end="01:00.750">眼差し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼神悲伤凝望那回首的背影</span></p><p begin="01:00.750" end="01:04.278" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:00.750" end="01:01.438">ありが</span><span begin="01:01.438" end="01:02.622">とうとごめんを</span><span begin="01:02.622" end="01:03.772">繰り返すま</span><span begin="01:03.772" end="01:04.278">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一遍遍反复地说着</span></p><p begin="01:04.397" end="01:06.586" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:04.397" end="01:05.277">踏み出した</span><span begin="01:05.277" end="01:06.586">01</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏出最初的步伐</span></p><p begin="01:06.586" end="01:11.153" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:06.586" end="01:07.298">毎度</span><span begin="01:07.298" end="01:08.439">最高な</span><span begin="01:08.613" end="01:09.966">未来をどこか</span><span begin="01:09.966" end="01:10.283">期待し</span><span begin="01:10.283" end="01:10.766">てい</span><span begin="01:10.766" end="01:11.153">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一次都期待着</span></p><p begin="01:11.227" end="01:17.253" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:11.227" end="01:12.131">抗う</span><span begin="01:12.131" end="01:12.920">まま生きる</span><span begin="01:12.920" end="01:13.237">不幸</span><span begin="01:13.237" end="01:14.009">を</span><span begin="01:14.009" end="01:14.793">受け入れ</span><span begin="01:14.793" end="01:15.478">るならば</span><span begin="01:15.478" end="01:16.926">自由を探し</span><span begin="01:16.926" end="01:17.253">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接纳活在抗争中的不幸</span></p><p begin="01:17.253" end="01:21.918" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:17.253" end="01:17.983">赤色の</span><span begin="01:17.983" end="01:18.645">創造</span><span begin="01:18.645" end="01:19.077">が</span><span begin="01:19.295" end="01:19.946">逆巻き</span><span begin="01:19.946" end="01:21.495">ぼくらはどうかして</span><span begin="01:21.495" end="01:21.918">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赤色的创造汹涌翻滚</span></p><p begin="01:21.918" end="01:27.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:21.918" end="01:22.793">割り切れ</span><span begin="01:22.793" end="01:23.459">ないこの</span><span begin="01:23.459" end="01:23.926">理由</span><span begin="01:23.926" end="01:24.339">を</span><span begin="01:24.643" end="01:25.443">抱きしめ</span><span begin="01:25.443" end="01:26.239">ては歌う</span> <span begin="01:26.239" end="01:26.607">今日</span><span begin="01:26.607" end="01:27.902">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带着这个难以理解的理由</span></p><p begin="01:28.077" end="01:30.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:28.077" end="01:28.627">ここで</span><span begin="01:28.627" end="01:29.285">人間</span><span begin="01:29.285" end="01:29.925">辞めまし</span><span begin="01:29.925" end="01:30.243">た！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此放弃了做人</span></p><p begin="01:30.243" end="01:33.332" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:30.243" end="01:30.624">重</span><span begin="01:30.624" end="01:31.286">ねたラヴ</span><span begin="01:31.286" end="01:31.585">ゲーム</span><span begin="01:31.585" end="01:32.635">もうたくさん</span><span begin="01:32.635" end="01:33.332">でした</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次又一次的爱情游戏</span></p><p begin="01:33.332" end="01:36.934" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:33.332" end="01:33.729">切る</span><span begin="01:33.729" end="01:34.412">スイッチ</span><span begin="01:34.412" end="01:35.295">見当たら</span><span begin="01:35.295" end="01:36.009">なくなって</span><span begin="01:36.009" end="01:36.934">どれくらい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">关掉电源</span></p><p begin="01:36.934" end="01:40.025" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:36.934" end="01:37.809">はじめから</span><span begin="01:37.809" end="01:38.523">なかった</span><span begin="01:38.523" end="01:40.025">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从一开始就并不存在呢</span></p><p begin="01:44.046" end="01:46.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:44.046" end="01:44.598">ゼロが</span><span begin="01:44.598" end="01:45.280">並べば</span><span begin="01:45.280" end="01:46.296">安心です</span><span begin="01:46.296" end="01:46.440">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看见一串串数字零就安心吗？</span></p><p begin="01:46.440" end="01:50.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:46.440" end="01:47.443">「代わりがいる」</span><span begin="01:47.443" end="01:49.126">なんて言わせたくなかっ</span><span begin="01:49.126" end="01:50.010">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿被他人说</span></p><p begin="01:49.427" end="01:52.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:49.427" end="01:50.264">さみしさの</span><span begin="01:50.264" end="01:51.128">果てひとり</span><span begin="01:51.128" end="01:51.632">踊れ</span><span begin="01:51.632" end="01:52.114">ますか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在寂寞的尽头 我能独自起舞吗</span></p><p begin="01:52.114" end="01:54.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:52.114" end="01:52.671">錆びた</span><span begin="01:52.813" end="01:53.264">ナイフ</span><span begin="01:53.264" end="01:54.106">捨て時は</span><span begin="01:54.106" end="01:54.778">逃した</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">丢掉生锈的小刀 时间已经溜走</span></p><p begin="01:54.778" end="01:58.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:54.778" end="01:55.362">渇か</span><span begin="01:55.447" end="01:55.965">ないで</span><span begin="01:55.965" end="01:56.599">このまま</span><span begin="01:56.599" end="01:57.114">ダンス</span><span begin="01:57.114" end="01:57.631">ダンス</span><span begin="01:57.631" end="01:58.231">ワルツ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要无视了自己的渴求 就这样</span></p><p begin="01:58.231" end="02:02.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:58.231" end="01:58.634">ねぇ</span><span begin="01:58.634" end="01:59.802">そっちはどうで</span><span begin="01:59.802" end="02:00.368">す</span><span begin="02:00.818" end="02:02.946">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 你感觉如何？</span></p><p begin="02:21.603" end="02:24.972" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:21.603" end="02:22.457">さよなら</span><span begin="02:22.457" end="02:23.124">がその</span><span begin="02:23.124" end="02:24.042">静けさが</span><span begin="02:24.167" end="02:24.972">澄み渡る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告别与静谧蔓延在晴朗天空下</span></p><p begin="02:24.972" end="02:26.676" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:24.972" end="02:26.300">さあここがはじま</span><span begin="02:26.300" end="02:26.676">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看吧 这就是开始</span></p><p begin="02:26.797" end="02:29.419" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:26.797" end="02:27.589">「目を逸らす</span><span begin="02:27.589" end="02:28.122">な」</span><span begin="02:28.122" end="02:29.419">言い聞かせては</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">劝诫自己“不要移开视线”</span></p><p begin="02:29.446" end="02:32.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:29.446" end="02:30.195">最後の</span><span begin="02:30.249" end="02:31.265">はじめまして</span><span begin="02:31.265" end="02:32.095">よろしく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后一次说初次见面请多关照</span></p><p begin="02:32.095" end="02:34.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:32.095" end="02:32.778">「眠ら</span><span begin="02:32.778" end="02:33.274">ないで」</span><span begin="02:33.274" end="02:33.973">身体が</span><span begin="02:33.973" end="02:34.763">叫んでる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“不要睡着”身体在呐喊</span></p><p begin="02:34.763" end="02:37.398" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:34.763" end="02:35.648">早鐘を</span><span begin="02:35.648" end="02:36.798">打て浮き彫りの</span><span begin="02:36.798" end="02:37.398">ハート</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连连敲响急促的钟声凸显真正的内心</span></p><p begin="02:37.398" end="02:40.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:37.398" end="02:37.811">言い</span><span begin="02:37.811" end="02:38.611">残した</span><span begin="02:38.611" end="02:39.310">言葉じゃ</span><span begin="02:39.310" end="02:39.827">頼り</span><span begin="02:39.827" end="02:40.742">ないから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为残留的话语实在太不可靠</span></p><p begin="02:40.742" end="02:44.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:40.742" end="02:41.894">いつも踏み出</span><span begin="02:41.894" end="02:42.587">す</span><span begin="02:42.742" end="02:44.464">01</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远都能从起点迈步出发</span></p><p begin="02:44.271" end="02:48.853" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:44.271" end="02:44.927">毎度</span><span begin="02:44.927" end="02:46.053">最高な</span><span begin="02:46.276" end="02:47.543">未来をどこか</span><span begin="02:47.543" end="02:47.961">期待し</span><span begin="02:47.961" end="02:48.409">てい</span><span begin="02:48.409" end="02:48.853">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一次都期待着</span></p><p begin="02:48.915" end="02:54.838" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:48.915" end="02:49.819">抗う</span><span begin="02:49.819" end="02:50.608">まま生きる</span><span begin="02:50.608" end="02:50.925">不幸</span><span begin="02:50.925" end="02:51.697">を</span><span begin="02:51.697" end="02:52.481">受け入れ</span><span begin="02:52.481" end="02:53.166">るならば</span><span begin="02:53.166" end="02:54.614">自由を探し</span><span begin="02:54.614" end="02:54.838">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接纳活在抗争中的不幸</span></p><p begin="02:54.838" end="02:59.503" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:54.838" end="02:55.568">赤色の</span><span begin="02:55.568" end="02:56.230">創造</span><span begin="02:56.230" end="02:56.662">が</span><span begin="02:56.880" end="02:57.531">逆巻き</span><span begin="02:57.531" end="02:59.080">ぼくらはどうかして</span><span begin="02:59.080" end="02:59.503">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赤色的创造汹涌翻滚</span></p><p begin="02:59.573" end="03:05.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="02:59.573" end="03:00.453">割り切れ</span><span begin="03:00.453" end="03:01.104">ないこの</span><span begin="03:01.104" end="03:01.552">理由</span><span begin="03:01.552" end="03:02.010">を</span><span begin="03:02.320" end="03:03.120">抱きしめ</span><span begin="03:03.120" end="03:03.943">ては歌う</span> <span begin="03:03.943" end="03:04.308">今日</span><span begin="03:04.308" end="03:05.677">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带着这个难以理解的理由</span></p></div></body></tt>